      "backgroundHint": "dark",
      "headings": [],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Agents work inside your existing workflows, detecting anomalies and turning days of coordination into a ranked recommendation your team can act on immediately.",
        "Orchestration pulls subsurface, operations, commercial, and finance into one connected workflow, so a field event triggers the right response automatically.",
        "Every answer is grounded in your own operational data by solutions purpose-built for your distinct workflows, never from generic models or data outside your operations.",
        "Production, AFE status, contracts, scheduling, and financial exposure live in one shared operational picture, so every decision and every agent runs on trustworthy context.",
        "Every recommendation is fully explainable and defensible, so your team can approve, modify, or override with full visibility into how the system got there.",
        "Agents, orchestration, data, and governance tie into one foundation, closing the loop between the field and the boardroom so performance keeps improving."
      ],
